  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.137\n\nReleased on 2026-10-06.\n\nCompositions with large inline images or scripts use far less memory while they load for preview. Whisper transcription detects the spoken language and can report progress.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Studio:** Audio clips that reach the export ceiling now say “Too loud”, with the exact peak on hover or keyboard focus ([4905b4dbc](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/4905b4dbca74ddff8e9302a0fe00fa74ddd7d056), [#5099](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5099)).\n- **Core:** Large inline images and scripts use far less memory while a composition loads ([00342fc2b](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/00342fc2be0a9905dd67cc218d713aeca19b5e3f), [#5098](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5098)).\n- **CLI:** With Whisper, `transcribe` detects the spoken language instead of assuming English, and `--json` reports download and transcription progress. The new `--no-runtime-install` flag stops it installing the Whisper runtime ([1db44c659](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/1db44c659565a5a70a39fbe836c497afe9a84d6d), [#5103](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5103)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.136...v0.8.137\n"
